  "slug": "the-inner-roo-m-may6-2026",
  "description": "<p>Step into Bandra’s newest midweek experience at Mitron, where music, fashion, and elevated social energy come</p><p>together under one roof.</p><p>A reason to step out midweek, built around sound, connection, and a thoughtfully curated atmosphere where every</p><p>detail shifts the energy and turns an ordinary Wednesday into the place everyone wants to be.</p><p>Inner Room is built to pull you in from the second you enter. With the DJ at the centre of the room, the crowd</p><p>moves around the music from every side, making the whole space feel alive and locked into one energy.</p><p>Think warm amber glow, statement lighting, clean visuals, and a setup that flips Mitron into a whole new midweek</p><p>mood. Intimate enough to feel exclusive, loud enough to feel unforgettable.</p><p>Expect camera-ready moments, nonstop movement, and the kind of social buzz that keeps the night flowing. From the</p><p>dancefloor to select guest corners, The Inner Room is not just somewhere you go, it’s somewhere you feel</p>",
